   "text": "# Education-Data\nThe project involved drawing inferences from 3 case studies, namely - Wholesale Customer Data, University Survey Data &amp; Manufacturing Shingles Data. The concepts of various measures of Descriptive Statistics, Probability and Probability Distributions and various measures of Estimation &amp; Hypothesis Testing are used to analyse these case studies.\n",
